## Commands

```bash
uv run pytest           # Test
uv run ruff format .    # Format
uv run ruff check .     # Lint
uv run ty check src/    # Type check
make check              # All checks
```

## Testing

```bash
# Unit tests
uv run pytest tests/ -v

# With coverage
uv run pytest tests/ -v --cov=src/mcp_{{name_underscore}} --cov-report=term-missing
```

## Releasing

Uses mcpb-pack v2 workflow. Releases trigger on `release: published`.

```bash
# Bump version
make bump VERSION=0.2.0

# Commit and tag
git add -A && git commit -m "Bump version to 0.2.0"
git tag v0.2.0 && git push origin main v0.2.0
gh release create v0.2.0 --title "v0.2.0" --notes "- changelog"
```

## Local Testing with mpak

```bash
mpak config set @nimblebraininc/{{name}} api_key=your_key_here
mpak run @nimblebraininc/{{name}}
```

Claude Code config (`~/.claude/settings.json`):
```json
{
  "mcpServers": {
    "{{name}}": {
      "command": "mpak",
      "args": ["run", "@nimblebraininc/{{name}}"]
    }
  }
}
```

## Adding New Endpoints

1. Add response model to `api_models.py`
2. Add client method to `api_client.py`
3. Add MCP tool to `server.py`
4. Add unit test to `tests/`
